      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "1CO",
          "chapter": 9,
          "verse": 23
        }
      ],
      "en": "Now I do this for the sake of the Good News, that I may be a joint partaker of it.",
      "ko": "내가 복음을 위하여 모든 것을 행함은 복음에 참예하고자 함이라",
      "source_text_hash": "5a7c56f13c954b7330b12a5a881418ddbd59db08f6eac07b31c98b7650e5d2ec",
      "translation_text_hash": "a69df69f594297e7715d0962c40cb6a1ccfc9348e1ea0263a6abf2415e2dd5ea",
