      "en": "I therefore run like that, not aimlessly. I fight like that, not beating the air,",
      "ko": "그러므로 내가 달음질하기를 향방 없는것 같이 아니하고 싸우기를 허공을 치는것 같이 아니하여",
      "source_text_hash": "0a3260800553fb6bbffa0b8c172c3f3b56824f91a744d2a42344071b350e9d40",
      "translation_text_hash": "60024dd723291d54375af3f07bc81c1d46e2651e8de1992a7b03e2d15a93534f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그러므로 내가 달음질하기를 향방 없는것 같이 아니하고 싸우기를 허공을 치는것 같이 아니하여"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "60024dd723291d54375af3f07bc81c1d46e2651e8de1992a7b03e2d15a93534f"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:1CO:9:27",
      "sequence": 28564,
      "chapter_label": "1CO 9",
      "verse_label": "27",
      "locator": {
        "book": "1CO",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 27
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "1CO",
          "chapter": 9,
          "verse": 27
        }
      ],
      "en": "but I beat my body and bring it into submission, lest by any means, after I have preached to others, I myself should be disqualified.",
      "ko": "내가 내 몸을 쳐 복종하게 함은 내가 남에게 전파한 후에 자기가 도리어 버림이 될까 두려워함이로라",
      "source_text_hash": "2119436fd42d91d1205e5d79d6c0e3822db2a58fbc4d9d6312829b26e5776f71",
      "translation_text_hash": "2f9f28a9e885a10c099118feda93c31d5bf46b65c5a6964b2da5c274ffa8b6d9",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
